{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1a80ffcae25c879e85336922bac1d02a62cbefada6656128a8ed9ba5983ea6",
      "text": "洽谈中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d772cb473b7f7d46658c1b2f8f5f641968b994f758c77e114b5acf67d1f350b",
      "text": "只要是支持彩的粉丝，\n对日本传统工艺的接受门槛应该也相对较低才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccee34f516ef17e7c479e63d1f682eaacf00c785b6cfcae21fab015ee8b5c00",
      "text": "基于这样的考量，这次才向各位提出了举办小型演出的邀约。\n还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a91635acb602759590e935bbe47baa8103a7249d87680bfecf37b6aba7152cd0",
      "text": "请包在我们身上！彩的成员们在成为偶像前，\n就已投身于传统艺术，有着极深的造诣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64e04f660441be17db544893cc78a66092c54169b89d7afc1228f927187f04d",
      "text": "如您所言，\n我也认为与传统工艺品有着极高的契合度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6ccea84de53d7021b84e0da7da5a7076094dbb629c24baf708a34c4fefa0368",
      "text": "（这些老师的想法，或许与在下十分接近。\n既然如此……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1025f88155b8af4c9648f4f39106b076a24ecd1c6cc3b2dde59485ea527d0535",
      "text": "制作人，在下有一个提议想商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5a9101bf80229d386d73b82ededbc41b746915d6afceefc66b1804166b83cd",
      "text": "好的。请问是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5beb9410eca12a0397968fea8d1f76d60d48e39f2b76eba5f40a81bd23321914",
      "text": "在演出之外，在下也想提供一些其他协助。\n不知猫柳先生和华村先生意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb412cdf0717178722f1c0e0ed8962de3868a9fc0b7fa9a0c44f007585747111",
      "text": "听起来很不错嘛！这主意，我赞成。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd23933aeb243b535fa6d4c0fd45fca1b6a468590105fa5a0aa5ca68f985d6f",
      "text": "咱也举双手赞成喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ed82264cadf7af38ce2d2061e99e960f340c49465641e5fe1e1bc5414cd2e1b",
      "text": "制作人，您意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
